sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    participant PayLink
    participant ElectroCo
    participant SMS as SMS Gateway
    participant Push as Push Service

    Customer->>PayLink: Pay electricity bill (meter number)
    PayLink->>PayLink: Check verification level and daily limit
    PayLink->>ElectroCo: Get bill (meter number)
    ElectroCo-->>PayLink: Bill amount
    PayLink->>PayLink: Add 2.50 EGP service fee
    PayLink-->>Customer: Show total (bill + 2.50 EGP fee)
    Customer->>PayLink: Confirm payment

    PayLink->>PayLink: Fraud checks (daily limit, payments in last minute, blocked account)

    alt Fraud checks pass
        PayLink->>PayLink: Move total from available balance to held balance
        PayLink->>ElectroCo: Send payment (unique reference)
        ElectroCo-->>PayLink: Confirm payment (reference)
        PayLink->>PayLink: Turn hold into final charge
        PayLink->>PayLink: Credit fee income
        opt Agent involved
            PayLink->>PayLink: Record agent commission
        end
        PayLink->>SMS: Send payment confirmation SMS
        SMS-->>Customer: SMS
        PayLink->>Push: Send push notification
        Push-->>Customer: Push notification
    else Fraud checks fail
        PayLink-->>Customer: Payment rejected (reason)
    end
